<!--
  NewTypeEngineLib — prebuilt static library (docs/prebuilt_dist.md).

  Compiles the curated ENGINE_SOURCES manifest (shared with
  tools/generate_project.py) + the runtime DLL machinery (_DEBUG only) +
  cinder's glad.c against static /MD(d) cinder and the LuisaCompute import
  libs. Debug serves both plain-Debug and Debug_Runtime (RT_RUNTIME)
  consumers — the machinery is keyed on _DEBUG, never on RT_RUNTIME.

  The dev exe stays source-compiled; this project is built on demand and by
  tools/package_dist.py (the solution maps it ActiveCfg-only, so normal
  Debug/Release solution builds skip it). No /GL/LTCG: consumers link the
  same .lib from both VS and msbuild without PGO/LTCG toolchain coupling.
-->
